  "headline": "Esomeprazole sodium is not on FDA's shortage list; two hospital sites hold 25 and 29 days of supply and the registered plants for two labels show only VAI inspections",
  "headline_cites": ["D1", "D2", "E11", "E16"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage database does not list esomeprazole sodium as in shortage as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 443 units at 17.6 units per day, providing 25 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 551 units at 19.2 units per day, providing 29 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "One label (NDC 68083045110) names Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3002647489) as the manufacturing plant with a last inspection classification of VAI on 2024-07-25.",
      "cites": ["E11", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second label (NDC 70436019082) names Hainan Poly Pharm. Co., Ltd. (FEI 3005115952) as the manufacturing plant with a last inspection classification of VAI on 2023-06-30.",
      "cites": ["E16", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both plants have histories of VAI classifications only, with no OAI or NAI findings recorded in the available inspection records.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E12", "E13", "E14", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Verify current allocation status with Eugia US LLC and confirm whether the labeled plants are actively supplying your NDCs.",
